# Auto-Commit & Push

After completing code changes to this project, automatically:

1. Stage all changes: `git add -A`
2. Commit with a clear message describing the changes
3. Push to origin: `git push`

Do not commit if the user explicitly asked not to, or if changes were exploratory/reverted.
